[38;5;231m⏺[39m Before I write this: [38;5;153mmigrations/003_drop_notes.sql[39m would be a one-way data loss. [38;5;153mALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN notes[39m
  deletes the notes values for all 48,000 production rows the README mentions, and the migration itself has no way back
